      "rationale": "Reviewed the authorized card and pinned benchmark forward/block source against local round31 outcomes. Latest knowledge usage documents consideration but no imported component, so its declared use is not evidence of a mechanism. Resolve/read access to original paper provides provenance only. A narrow auxiliary-adapter edge factorial is justified before replacing the whole architecture.",
